    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Rust compiler supports building with some dependencies from `crates.io`.",
      "source_hash": 2889847864396783672,
      "context_hash": 7274667511986485736,
      "translation": "Rust 컴파일러는 `crates.io`에서 가져온 일부 의존성을 사용한 빌드를 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:02:30.361249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust Forge has [official policy for vetting new dependencies].",
      "source_hash": 16176500092985422866,
      "context_hash": 14220011881154816614,
      "translation": "Rust Forge에는 [새 의존성 검토에 관한 공식 정책][official policy for vetting new dependencies]이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:02:30.361249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Permitted dependencies",
      "source_hash": 16603282674274299584,
      "context_hash": 10388777232213179383,
      "translation": "허용된 의존성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:02:30.361250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The `tidy` tool has [a list of crates that are allowed].",
      "source_hash": 453271020165087209,
      "context_hash": 14804624005517490618,
      "translation": "`tidy` 도구에는 [허용된 크레이트 목록][a list of crates that are allowed]이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:02:30.361250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "To add a dependency that is not already in the compiler, you will need to add it to the list.",
      "source_hash": 2345688519681718543,
      "context_hash": 4169741602604739409,
      "translation": "컴파일러에 아직 포함되지 않은 의존성을 추가하려면 해당 의존성을 이 목록에 추가해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:02:30.361250Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
